Think investing has to be boring or confusing? Think again! Join Jon Erlichman as he breaks down the latest market news, investment tips, and money moves — all served with a side of wit and zero financial mumbo jumbo. Whether you’re a newbie trying to figure out what a “ticker” even is, or a seasoned investor looking for a fresh take, Ticker Take makes finance fun, friendly, and maybe even a little entertaining. Tune in, learn something, and maybe laugh along the way. Your wallet will thank you.

